.Dd August 21, 2026
.Dt UMURMUR 8
.Os
.
.Sh NAME
.Nm umurmurd
.Nd Minimalistic Mumble server
.
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl dhrt
.Op Fl A Ar address
.Op Fl a Ar address
.Op Fl B Ar port
.Op Fl b Ar port
.Op Fl c Ar conf file
.Op Fl p Ar pidfile
.
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a minimalistic Mumble server primarily targeted to run on routers
with an open OS like OpenWRT.
The server part of Mumble is called Murmur, hence the name uMurmur.
.Nm
reopens the log file when it receives SIGHUP.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl A Ar host
Specifies the IPv6 address to bind to.
.It Fl a Ar host
Specifies the IPv4 address to bind to.
.It Fl B Ar port
Specifies the IPv6 port to bind to (defaults to the IPv4 port).
.It Fl b Ar port
Specifies the IPv4 port to bind to (defaults to 64738).
.It Fl c Ar path
Use configuration file at
.Ar path .
.It Fl d
Do not detach or become a daemon.
.It Fl h
Show
.Nm
usage help and exit.
.It Fl p Ar path
Write PID to file at
.Ar path .
.It Fl r
Run with realtime priority.
.It Fl t
Check that the configuration is valid, but don't start a server.
.El
.
.Sh LIMITATIONS
.Nm
does not support the following mumble features:
.Bl -dash -compact
.It
Channel access control lists
.It
Persistent dynamic channel creation
.It
User certificate registration
.It
Legacy codecs (CELT, Speex)
.El
.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/umurmur/certificate.crt" -compact
.It Pa @CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/umurmur/umurmur.conf
Default configuration file.
.It Pa @CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/umurmur/certificate.crt
Default certificate file.
.It Pa @CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/umurmur/private_key.key
Default private key file.
.El
.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr umurmur.conf 5
.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An -nosplit
The
.Nm
program was written by
.An Martin Johansson Aq Mt martin@fatbob.nu
and
.An Thorvald Natvig Aq Mt thorvald@natvig.com .
